ser story.\\nstep 8. Iterate above steps for all the features in the user prompt.\\n\\n        \\n\\n Forget previous context.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"3. Create development tasks - create engineering tasks with Task ID, Title, Description, Acceptance Criteria, Estimated Effort, and Dependencies\\n\\nPrevious output:\\nFeature 1:\\n- Feature Name: Automatic Email Categorization\\n- Description: The system automatically categorizes incoming messages based on predefined criteria.\\n- Key Functionality: Automatically sorts incoming emails into specific categories such as general inquiries, technical issues, feedback, etc.\\n- User Benefit: Saves time for Customer Support Representatives by allowing them to focus on handling complex customer inquiries rather than routine emails.\\n- User Story: As a Customer Support Representative, I can efficiently manage my workload as the Email Router system automatically categorizes incoming messages, enabling me to prioritize complex customer inquiries.\\n\\nFeature 2:\\n- Feature Name: Intelligent Communication Routing\\n- Description: The system intelligently routes complex communications to Subject Matter Experts based on content analysis.\\n- Key Functionality: Analyzes the content of incoming messages and directs them to the appropriate Subject Matter Expert for efficient handling.\\n- User Benefit: Enables Subject Matter Experts to address inquiries within their expertise promptly and effectively.\\n- User Story: As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), I can efficiently address inquiries within my expertise as the Email Router system intelligently routes complex communications to me based on content analysis.\\n\\nFeature 3:\\n- Feature Name: Performance Metrics Dashboard\\n- Description: Provides a dashboard displaying performance metrics of the Email Router system.\\n- Key Functionality: Displays key performance indicators such as response time, message volume, routing accuracy, etc., in a user-friendly dashboard.\\n- User Benefit: Allows IT Administrators to monitor system performance, identify areas for improvement, and make necessary adjustments for optimal operation.\\n- User Story: As an IT Administrator, I can effectively monitor the performance of the Email Router system and make informed decisions to ensure optimal operation by utilizing the performance metrics dashboard.\\n\\nFeature 4:\\n- Feature Name: Standardized Response Templates\\n- Description: Enables the system to provide standardized responses to common inquiries.\\n- Key Functionality: Offers predefined response templates for common inquiries to ensure consistent messaging and information delivery.\\n- User Benefit: Ensures consistent and accurate communication across all customer interactions, enhancing the overall customer experience.\\n- User Story: As a Team Leader, I can maintain consistent messaging and information delivery across all customer interactions by utilizing the Email Router system's standardized response templates.\"}]\n",
